Model Weights License Notice
============================

Scope
-----

This notice covers the patched Gemma 4 31B-it GGUF files distributed in
this release bundle (three HuggingFace repositories, one per quantization
tier, each holding the L25+L26 ×1.5 mix patch):

- `gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-IQ1_M.gguf`  (morphicode-jp/gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-IQ1_M)
- `gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-Q2_K.gguf`   (morphicode-jp/gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-Q2_K)
- `gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-Q4_K_M.gguf` (morphicode-jp/gemma-4-31B-it-L25L26x1.5-Q4_K_M)

The per-layer ablation patches (L25-alone, L26-alone) and the triple
(LOS27+PAN17+PAN43 ×1.8) discussed in the paper are NOT distributed as
separate GGUFs; they are reproducible from `bake_l25_l26_split.py` and
`bake_triple_patch.py` in the GitHub repository. The license notice below
applies equally to any GGUF derivative produced by those scripts.

